  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築賞析",
    "sub_ename": "COMPREHENSION ON ARCHITECTURE",
    "describe_ch": "學習建立欣賞分析建築作品的(三維)架構，以X向度－人文環境（社會與文化環境、技術文明、地域特性…），Y向度－自然環境（氣候、地質、地形、…），Z向度－建築師之特質（個人成長環境－家 庭背景、能力、教育歷程與專業素養、信仰、價值觀、性格、際遇…）介紹案例為下列建築大師之作: 包括西班牙安東尼高第、柯布、路易康等，作深入分析與欣賞探究",
    "describe_eh": "To learn to establish a framework of both appreciating and analyzing  architectural works, which is consisted of the  three dimensions- by taking the X-axis served as human factors, the Y-axis as natural factors and the Z-axis as the architect's features (including his family, intelligence, educational background and professional training, value and religion, character, fortune etc.). The example projects introduced are the masterpiece of the following architects- A. Gaudi,  Le Corbusier, L. Kahn's  buildings etc.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
